<section class="section future" id="future" aria-labelledby="future-title">
  <div class="section-inner future-spread">
    <header class="future-intro" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="future-title">还有些小事，<br />想一起做。</h2>
      <p>想到一件就写下来。<br />不用着急，一件一件来。</p>
      <button class="draw-button" type="button" data-wish-draw data-needs-js><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> 从清单里抽一件</button>
      <p class="draw-result" data-wish-result role="status" data-needs-js></p>
    </header>
    <div class="future-paper" data-reveal>
      <span class="tape tape-corner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="future-paper-head"><h3>往后的小清单</h3><span data-wish-count data-needs-js>还空着</span></div>
      <p class="wish-empty" data-wish-empty>第一件，留给我们自己写。</p>
      <ul class="wish-list" data-wish-list></ul>
      <form class="wish-form" data-wish-form data-needs-js>
        <label class="sr-only" for="wish-text">想一起做的小事</label>
        <input id="wish-text" type="text" maxlength="120" required placeholder="写下一件想一起做的事" autocomplete="off" />
        <button class="pencil-button" type="submit">记上</button>
      </form>
      <noscript><p class="paper-local">开启 JavaScript 后，可以写清单。</p></noscript>
    </div>
    <div class="notebook-tools" data-needs-js>
      <p>这些记录只留在这台设备，不会同步给对方。清理浏览器前，记得带走一份。</p>
      <div class="paper-actions"><button class="text-button" type="button" data-notebook-export>带走手账 ↓</button><button class="text-button" type="button" data-notebook-import>放回备份 ↑</button></div>
      <input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-notebook-file hidden aria-label="选择手账备份" />
      <p class="notebook-status" data-notebook-status role="status"></p>
      <button class="text-button" type="button" data-notebook-undo hidden>撤销刚才的移除</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
